# Upload ignore list for the Wesnoth add-on server.
# This file replaces the engine defaults (src/filesystem.cpp, 1.19.29),
# so the default patterns are repeated first. Patterns match bare names.

# Engine defaults
.+
#*#
*~
*-bak
*.swp
*.pbl
*.ign
_info.cfg
*.exe
*.bat
*.cmd
*.com
*.scr
*.sh
*.js
*.vbs
*.o
*.ini
Thumbs.db
*.wesnoth
*.project
.+/
__MACOSX/

# Development files: instructions and translation sources.
# The engine loads the compiled catalogs in translations/*/LC_MESSAGES/.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
README.md
*.po
*.pot
